    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On Call</strong> is the helpline simulator where YOU get to fix everyone else's problems while your own life falls apart! Isn't that fun?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TALK TO WEIRDOS (WITH YOUR ACTUAL MOUTH SOUNDS)</strong> Use your real voice to help a zombie who's lactose intolerant, a hippie who can't find the van, or a wizard whose spells keep autocorrecting. Thanks to a local AI, these nutjobs actually listen and respond to whatever nonsense you say! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR DEPRESSION STATION</strong> Start with a desk held together by prayers and duct tape. End with a  setup so fancy it makes streamers weep. Get weird decorations, fun mugs and posters, and computer parts that unlock access to even MORE problematic individuals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR  REGULAR CALLERS INCLUDE:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vampire who faints at the sight of blood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A guy who keeps seeing ghosts in his selfies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien worried about getting abducted by humans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus 100+ other disasters disguised as people</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLACK OFF LIKE A PROFESSIONAL</strong> Between existential crises, play with your digital fish or watch tiny balls bounce around in Blinko while questioning your life choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCK RIDICULOUS ACHIEVEMENTS\u00a0</strong>Successfully talk a toaster out of world domination? Boom \u2013 unlock a  toast poster for your setup! Mediate a divorce between the moon and sun? Score a new mug that makes you look important! Each bonkers achievement unlocks new decorations, special caller access, and bragging rights that literally no one will believe.</p>",
